      "message": "You might want to make it clear it\u0027s ABL that provides the VM DTBO (to both pvmfw and host).\n\nAlso, this section should probably start by briefly explaining _why_ the VM DTBO exists in the first place i.e. that its main use (at least, on the host) is to allow passing extra properties of assignable platform devices to the guest (which can\u0027t be discovered from the HW) while keeping the VMM device-agnostic. This then makes it clear why we mandate nodes having labels.",
