      "message": "In terms of narration, I\u0027d personally start with explaining the VM DTBO\u0027s `\u0026{/}`, its use by the VMM, and it\u0027s availability through `dtbo.img` (i.e. the whole host side) before then explaining its `/host`, validation by pvmfw, and the config data i.e. split the explanation between functional then security aspects.\n\nAlso, why not introduce the high-level XML first (giving you a chance to explain VFIO and us only supporting platform devices) before diving into the low-level details with the VM DTBO?",
